# Pad script for the harness probe: "FRAME BUTTONS", buttons held from that
# program frame until the next line. '+' combines buttons, NONE releases all.
#
# Drives pacman_2d out of its spawn corridor and around the lower-left of the
# maze, so a run demonstrably eats pellets rather than sitting still.
#
#   probe.exe ... --pad-script harness/scripts/pacman_demo.pad
#
# Frames are program frames (one per emulated frame once the vblank sync is
# working), so these numbers are real sixtieths of a second.

0    NONE
30   LEFT      # off the spawn tile, eating along row 20
120  UP        # up the left side
200  RIGHT
260  UP
320  RIGHT     # across the top
440  DOWN
520  LEFT
600  NONE
